  "bodyHash": "OLcjY4sxfiE=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Description.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">這個模組旨在讓玩家體驗中世紀騎士的感覺。目前，該模組包含大量新的旗幟圖案、16套盔甲、8種盾牌和26種武器，其中大多數可使用11種材料製作：木頭、石頭、鐵、金、鑽石、獄髓、鋼（新增）、銅、銀、錫、青銅。這些武器具有特殊功能，例如增加攻擊範圍和穿甲能力。此外，模組還添加了鋼鐵，且不會與其他模組的鋼鐵衝突。要製作鋼鐵，請將鐵錠放入高爐。使用此模組，您可以將旗幟附加到盔甲或馬鎧上（就像在盾牌上一樣），或添加盔甲裝飾——其中許多可以染成任何顏色。配置文件位於 <code>config/epicknights</code> 文件夾中。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>附加組件：<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Addon</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-dark-ages-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Dark Ages</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-slavic-armory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Slavic Armory</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-antique-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Antique Legacy</a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-ores-and-alloys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Ores and Alloys</a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-artillery-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Artillery Addon</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rk-medieval-boomsticks-and-sharpsticks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ranged Knights Medieval Boomsticks and Sharpsticks</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-open-helms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Open Helms</a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>重要提示：OptiFine 1.20 及更高版本會與包括本模組在內的許多模組產生衝突！<br></strong></span>自7.0版本起，本模組需要安裝Architectury和Cloth Config。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Roadmap.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jLgF2Sp/discord-new-2021-logo-45-D326-F28-C-seeklogo-com.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">如果您正在尋找一個使用Epic Knights盔甲及所有附加組件的歷史伺服器，歡迎查看 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/agVWxf8VGc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Greatest of Centuries</a>。這是一個陣營伺服器，專注於透過各種獨特機制和玩家驅動的角色扮演，重現君士坦丁堡陷落相關的衝突。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Compatibilities.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a><strong>：</strong>1.18.2+：提供預設支援。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>：<br>1.20.1 和 1.21.1：提供預設支援</p><p>若要將Epic Knights與舊版本的Epic Fight結合，請執行以下操作：</p><p>1.12.2：從 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord伺服器</a> 下載 epicfight.cfg 並將其放入 configs 資料夾。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">1.16.5、1.18.2、1.19.2：從 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord伺服器</a> 下載資料包，解壓縮後按照此教學操作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fTutorials%252fInstalling%252f_a%252f_data%252f_pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.fandom.com/wiki/Tutorials/Installing_a_data_pack</a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">32x32 材質包</a> 這裡有一個由 Reymecos 精心製作的 32x 材質包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overgeared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgeared</a>：<br>使用這些資料包使 Overgeared 與 Epic Knights 相容：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-epic-knights-armors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-epic-knights-armors</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-x-epic-knights-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-x-epic-knights-weapons</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Armor.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/478/sprite-0001-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3600\" height=\"3600\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Weapons.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1022/118/weapons-and-shield.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Designs.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/397/342/2021-09-26_19.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"1243\"></strong>請回報任何您發現的錯誤！！！是的，您可以在 CurseForge 和 Modrinth 上發佈的模組包中使用本模組。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
